   "title": "US tech stocks see sharp falls over AI cost fears",
   "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvwy72e0n72yo",
   "discussUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50306008",
   "points": 173,
